        <p>The virtues of Liquozone are derived solely from gases. The formula is sent to each user. The process of mak- ing requires large apparatus, and from 8 to 14 days time. It is directed by chemists of ths highest repute. The object is so to fix and combine the gases as to carry into the system a powerful tonic-germicide. Contact with Liquozone kills any form of disease germ.. Yet to the body Liquozone is not only harm- Ass, but helpful in the extreme. That is its main dis- tinction. Common germicides are poison when taken internally. That is why medicine has been so helpless in a germ disease. Liquozone is exhilarating, vitalizing I-unifying ; yet no disease germ can exist in it. We purchased the British rights of Liquozane after thousands of tests had been made with it. Its power had, been proved, again and again, in the most cliflicnit germ diseases. Then we offered to give</p>
