        <head>(To, be continued.%</head>
        <p>(To, be continued.%</p>
        <p>A Isly, who reltsed to give her name or address, drove op in brougham to where about a hundred med were making tin a road at llnttersea Rise and left a 1 ,tlantity of meat pies and buns with the foreman, who (,istributed them among the men.</p>
