        <p>This preparation is onquestionab-ly-OPe of the most genuine and reliable Patent Medicines ever introduced, and has we understand, been used in the Continental Hospitals by it du,L Pfa Malsonnenve the well-' indeed by all who are regarded ail k DI coor iao,: atg, n .70 o, b endrt. Vel authorities in such matters. Including the celebrated Lallernand. and Roux, by whom It was some time since uniformly adopted.and that it is worthy the attention of those who require such a remedy we think there is no doubt. F,om the time of Aristotle downwards a potent agent In the removal of three diseases has (like the famed philosopher's stone) been the object of search of some hopeiul generous minds ; and far beyond the mere power—if such could ever have been disoovered—of transmuting the baser metals into gold is surely the discovery of a remedy so potent as to re- plenish the falling energies In the one case, and In the other so effectually. speedry and safely to expel from the system the poisons of acquired or inherited disease in all their potent forms as to leave no taint or trace behind. Such is the new French Remedy THRRAPION, which may certainly rank with. if not take precedence of, many of the discoveries of our day, about which no little ostentation and noise have been made, end the extensive end ever-increasing demand that haa been created for this medicine wherever introduced appears to prove that it is destined to cast into oblivion all those questionable remedies that were formerly the sole reliance of medical men, Tberapion may be obtained of the principal demists and merchants throughout the world.— Diamond Fields Advertiser."—Kimberley.—Por particulars of Tberapton, send stamped, addressed envelope to MR. B- JORNSON, 4, HOLFORD SQ , LONDON, W-C.</p>
