      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-12-02_WidnesExaminer_art0080" n="art0080">
        <head>LEAGUE BUSINESS.</head>
        <p>LEAGUE BUSINESS.</p>
        <p>On Tuesday• afternoon and evening a meeting of the Northern League was held at Huddersfield. The follow- ing registrations were made :--Put on : Warrington, Owen Jones (Runcorn Felts) and A. Widdeson (('.hadder- ton and Broughton Rangers). A letter was read from the hon. secretary, pro. tem., of the proposed Liverpool Rugby Club, and it was decided that two representatives of the committee attend the first meeting on behalf of the committee. Foster, Warrington, and Stnbbs. Chadderton, for kicking eath other, were suspended until and including December 9th.</p>
      </div>
      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-12-02_WidnesExaminer_art0081" n="art0081">
        <head>STRONG CHILDREN.</head>
        <p>STRONG CHILDREN.</p>
        <p>Children grow strong on Cadbury's cocoa because it contains in a generous measure those food elements that are essential to health and good physical condition. it possesses the combined advanlages of being thirst-quenching. invigorating, and highly nourishing, and the children like it especially because it is " the nicest cocoa."</p>
        <p>Everybody should drink Cadbury's cocoa regularly at breakfast and lunch time, and particularly with the evening meal, because, owing to its mildly stimulative action, it is one of the few beverages that aid rather than retard the digestion of other foods. Cocoa is strongest when pure—Cadbury's is the strongest cocoa because it is the purest. It therefore makes most beverage of the best quality.</p>
        <p>the visitors' line, a try resulting. this being converted. Stockton Heath transferred play to the opposite end by good forward work, and Langley made a magnificent attempt to drop a goal, the ball going a few inches wide. Chester brpke away, a try resulting. From the drop-out, Stockton Heath took up) the attack, and although keeping Chester in their own half for the remainder of the game failed to break through. A good passing move:nent \by the backs ended in Ferguson being pushed into tovh at th 3 corner. Result : Chester College, one goal offek try (eight points) ; Stockton Heath, one goal (five points).</p>
